itle  and the series went on to spawn  many sequels with halo 5 being the most  recent mainline installment  the next chapter halo infinite is  currently in development and set to be  released this year  halo has not only become one of the  highest grossing video game franchises  of all time  but also one of the highest in media as  well with animated short films  books and more based on the halo  universe including  an upcoming tv show on showtime not to  mention the birth of community made  classics like rooster teeth red versus  blue  a lot has been accomplished in 20 years  and i'm ready to join chief for 20  more  [Music]  super smash bros was definitely a hit  but melee  was a home run all playable characters  from the first game  made their return and many new faces  from numerous nintendo franchises  joined the popular crossover game the  success of melee spanned from casual to  competitive  with high level tournaments and  exhibitions the series has gone on to  see the release of  three more mainline installments with  super smash bros ultimate being the most  recent which is  still regularly updated with new  characters  pokemon is too monumental to leave out  so we're making an exception and going  by japan's release date for pokemon red  in blue  february 27 1996 marked the beginning of  the powerhouse franchise that would go  on to expand across all types of media  and also become one of the highest  grossing video game franchises  of all time the pokemon company would  also go on to create  many different types of games across a  wide variety of platforms and handhelds  making it accessible to nearly everyone  whether you like rpgs  snapping pics of pokemon mini games or  even puzzles  there's probably something for you and  you can't forget about  mobile how about a bonus anniversary  pokemon go is turning five this year  and to this day pokemon is still going  strong and has already teased a 25th  anniversary celebration for 2021.  the resident evil 