d us to link and his quest to  save hyrule and princess zelda  with its mix of puzzles battle and  exploration  the legend of zelda series honed these  core pillars and expanded to dozens of  titles  with even more iconic adventures such as  lynx awakening  ocarina of time and majora's mask to  name a few  and the legacy isn't stopping there as  fans patiently wait for the release of  the breath of the wild sequel  in august of 1986 we met bounty hunter  samus iran and joined her as she  protected the galaxy from pirates  and parasites this action-adventure  series really boomed in popularity with  super metroid about 8 years later  but metroid is still known for its dark  atmosphere immersive music and mixture  of shooting and platforming gameplay  with about a dozen titles under its belt  the metroid series has seen  various styles of gameplay and the  newest installment of the series metro  prime 4  is still in the works the new  installments may be a little more story  driven than previous titles based on job  listings that popped up online in  october of 2020  looking for someone to help write  impactful stories 35 years later  in samus's adventures aren't done yet  donkey kong made his debut on july 31  1981  and was made to help nintendo break into  the north american market  the game not only introduced dk but also  introduced jumpman which is now as we  know him  mario dk and mario would go on to be two  of the most popular nintendo characters  and the game itself would become one of  the most popular arcade games of all  time  nintendo went on to release about 30  additional dk titles including the  popular  donkey kong country series and other  favorites like donkey kong 64  and the dk racing titles  40 years ago we learned just how hard it  was for an  innocent little frog to find his way  home frogger was released on october 23  1981 in arcades and had a  straightforward objective  hop across traffic and a river with way  too many logs  to get all the f